Good:
- Addictive gameplay;
- Long game;
- Fun to play;
- Nice 8-bit graphics;
- Lot's of characters and classes;
- Variation of enemys;
- Humor;
Neutral:
- Not much of a challenge, except towards the endgame;
- Achievements are, sometimes, too easy, sometimes, boring to get;
Bad:
- Repetitive;
- Bugged achievements;
- Menu, Item Menu and Equipment Menu are too much simplify, with lots of limitations;
- Although varied, the enemies have little different attacks, making battles not so strategic once you discover a good team;
Overrall:
- I was really surprised by this game, not expecting to be so addictive to it. I've had good times with this, and strongly recommend it, since the minor flaws aren't enough to compromise the good experience.

